  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-sectoral lifesaving assistance in Sa&apos;ada.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will be implemented in the Northern part of Yemen specifically in Hajjah and Sa&apos;ada Governorates. In Hajjah Governorate, the project will be implemented in 4 districts namely Thawab, Alwasat, Matwalah and Albatriyah Districts. In Sa&apos;ada Governorate it will be implemented in Majz, Rezeh, Sahar and Qataber Districts</narrative>
  </description>
